---
interface Props {
  section: string;
  title: string;
  sourcePath: string;
}

const { section, title, sourcePath } = Astro.props;
const repositoryUrl = "https://github.com/DraftOps1/blog";
const issueTitle = `[${section}] ${title}`;
const issueBody = [
  "## 記事",
  `- 種類: ${section}`,
  `- タイトル: ${title}`,
  `- URL: ${Astro.url.pathname}`,
  `- Markdown: \`${sourcePath}\``,
  "",
  "## コメント",
  "",
].join("\n");
const issueUrl = `${repositoryUrl}/issues/new?${new URLSearchParams({
  title: issueTitle,
  labels: "feedback",
  body: issueBody,
})}`;
---

<section>
  <h2>Feedback</h2>
  <p>記事名とURLを入れた Issue を作れます。ご感想などいただけると非常に嬉しいです。</p>
  <a class="button" href={issueUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Issue</a>
</section>
